Student Placement Prediction using Machine Learning

About

This is my first Machine Learning project, developed using Python and Google Colab. It predicts whether a student will be placed using a Decision Tree Classifier.

Technologies

- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

Dataset

The student dataset is created directly inside the Python notebook using a dictionary. No separate dataset file is required.

Algorithm

Decision Tree Classifier

Workflow

1. Create the dataset.
2. Prepare the features and target.
3. Split the data into training and testing sets.
4. Train the machine learning model.
5. Predict placement status.
6. Evaluate model accuracy.

How to Run

Open the notebook in Google Colab and run the cells in order.

Project Type

Beginner Machine Learning Project.
